NAME
       paste - merge lines of files

SYNOPSIS
       paste [-s] [-d LIST] [-z] file...

DESCRIPTION
       Merge lines. LIST is used in turn and takes \n \t \\
       and \0 (no delimiter).

SEE ALSO
       sh(1)

